Third-party components
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

hokusai
  Rust port of the libmypaint brush engine, compiled to WebAssembly.
  https://github.com/reearth/hokusai
  License: MIT / Apache-2.0

libmypaint
  The brush dynamics (pressure, tilt, speed response) this project relies on
  are derived from libmypaint's implementation.
  https://github.com/mypaint/libmypaint
  License: Apache-2.0

Electron / Chromium
  Application shell and rendering engine.
  https://www.electronjs.org/
  License: MIT

Rust standard library and wasm-bindgen
  Used by the compiled hokusai module.
  License: MIT / Apache-2.0

